<%!-- title: Content straight in the card | text: Without parts, whatever is placed in the card is padded evenly, like a bordered div. A card_heading outside a header takes size="lg" or "xl". --%>
<div class="flex justify-center rounded-lg bg-slate-50 p-6 dark:bg-navy-900 sm:p-10">
  <.card class="w-full max-w-sm">
    <.card_heading size="lg">Delete project</.card_heading>
    <p>Everything in it is removed for good, including the files and the history.</p>
    <.button color="error" class="self-start">Delete project</.button>
  </.card>
</div>
